	"data": "Reflection — May 22, 2018 Journal\n\nWhat I Read\n\ncithoreal at 20. Five days into a jogging habit. Just got hired at Home Depot as a cashier. Recording his fifth audio journal. The whole entry is a dream inventory — he's listing what he wants to build, and the list is long: a Corridor Digital-style creative collective (~10 talented friends), a makerspace with computers and a yard for drones, an outdoor blacksmith forge, a sensory deprivation tank, a VR clubhouse. AR/XR as his \"ultimate…",
